If acting for an entity, you must have authority to accept them for it.

2. Free content-production license

The Owner grants you a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to
install and use lawfully obtained official binary builds and their
documentation to create, edit, analyze, process and deliver content. This
permission covers individuals, professionals, businesses and organizations,
for personal and commercial content production, including paid client work.
There is no revenue threshold, per-output fee or royalty for these uses.

You may copy the binaries and documentation for installation, backup and
internal deployment on devices you own or control, including use by people
acting on your behalf under these terms. You may operate the Software
through general-purpose MCP clients, the CLI, scripts and private internal
applications for the permitted content-production work. Normal client
registration, connection instructions and configuration are permitted.

Editing parameters, presets, MIDI, automation and projects through the
documented interfaces is permitted. It is not a modification of the Software.
These permissions do not include the product and service uses in section 4.

3. Your content and outputs

You may publish, distribute, sell and otherwise commercially exploit the
