is permitted; incorporating the Software is subject to section 4.

The Owner claims no ownership, royalty or mandatory credit in your content
or Outputs merely because you used the Software. This agreement does not
grant rights in third-party recordings, samples, compositions or other
materials, or guarantee that any Output qualifies for copyright protection.
You remain responsible for obtaining the rights your use requires.
Software binaries, source code and copied documentation are not Outputs.

